request.description:
查询渠道可访问的酒店列表，支持按城市、关键词筛选，返回酒店基本信息、房型、设施等。

**响应示例：**
```json
{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "success",
  "data": {
    "total": 15,
    "page": 1,
    "pageSize": 20,
    "list": [{
      "hotelCode": "JJSH001",
      "chineseName": "上海锦江饭店",
      "city": "上海",
      "startingPrice": 688.00,
      "roomTypes": [...]
    }]
  }
}
```

查询指定酒店的详细信息，包括房型列表、每个房型下的价格计划、每日价格、取消政策、担保政策、包价信息等。

**响应示例：**
```json
{
  "code": 200,
  "data": {
    "hotel": { "hotelCode": "JJSH001", "chineseName": "上海锦江饭店", ... },
    "roomTypes": [{
      "roomTypeCode": "ST1",
      "roomTypeName": "标准双床房",
      "ratePlans": [{
        "ratePlanCode": "BAR",
        "ratePlanName": "门市价",
        "totalPrice": 1376.00,
        "dailyPrices": [{ "date": "2026-06-01", "priceWithTax": 688.00 }],
        "cancellationPolicy": { "type": "FREE_CANCEL", "freeCancelBeforeDays": 1 },
        "guaranteePolicy": { "type": "GUARANTEE", "subType": "FIRST_NIGHT" }
      }]
    }]
  }
}
```
